 119:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 120:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 121:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     [..]
 122:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     Use Function HAL_SMARTCARD_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
 123:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     Function HAL_SMARTCARD_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 124:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 125:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 126:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 127:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 128:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
 129:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
 130:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
 131:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
 132:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : SMARTCARD MspInit.
 133:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : SMARTCARD MspDeInit.
 134:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 135:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
 136:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 137:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     [..]
 138:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     Use function HAL_SMARTCARD_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 139:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     weak function.
 140:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     HAL_SMARTCARD_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 141:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     and the Callback ID.
