 264:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   * @brief    Initialization and Configuration functions
 265:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   *
