 268:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****               ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
 269:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   ==============================================================================
 270:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 271:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USARTx
 272:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   associated to the SmartCard.
 273:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   (+) These parameters can be configured:
 274:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Baud Rate
 275:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Parity: parity should be enabled, frame Length is fixed to 8 bits plus parity
 276:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
 277:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Synchronous mode (and if enabled, phase, polarity and last bit parameters)
 278:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Prescaler value
 279:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Guard bit time
 280:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) NACK enabling or disabling on transmission error
 281:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 282:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   (+) The following advanced features can be configured as well:
 283:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) TX and/or RX pin level inversion
 284:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) data logical level inversion
 285:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) RX and TX pins swap
 286:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) RX overrun detection disabling
 287:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) DMA disabling on RX error
 288:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) MSB first on communication line
 289:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Time out enabling (and if activated, timeout value)
 290:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Block length
 291:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****       (++) Auto-retry counter
 292:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 293:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   The HAL_SMARTCARD_Init() API follows the USART synchronous configuration procedures
 294:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   (details for the procedures are available in reference manual).
