 299:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 300:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     Table 1. USART frame format.
 301:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     +---------------------------------------------------------------+
 302:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     | M1M0 bits |  PCE bit  |            USART frame                |
 303:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     |-----------------------|---------------------------------------|
 304:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     |     01    |    1      |    | SB | 8 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 305:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     +---------------------------------------------------------------+
