 715:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****                          ##### IO operation functions #####
 716:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   ==============================================================================
 717:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 718:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to manage the SMARTCARD data transfers.
 719:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 720:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 721:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     Smartcard is a single wire half duplex communication protocol.
 722:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     The Smartcard interface is designed to support asynchronous protocol Smartcards as
 723:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     defined in the ISO 7816-3 standard. The USART should be configured as:
 724:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) 8 bits plus parity: where M=1 and PCE=1 in the USART_CR1 register
 725:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (+) 1.5 stop bits when transmitting and receiving: where STOP=11 in the USART_CR2 register.
 726:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 727:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 728:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) There are two modes of transfer:
 729:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) Blocking mode: The communication is performed in polling mode.
 730:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              The HAL status of all data processing is returned by the same function
 731:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              after finishing transfer.
 732:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) Non-Blocking mode: The communication is performed using Interrupts
 733:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              or DMA, the relevant API's return the HAL status.
 734:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              The end of the data processing will be indicated through the
 735:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              dedicated SMARTCARD IRQ when using Interrupt mode or the DMA IRQ when
 736:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              using DMA mode.
 737:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) The HAL_SMARTCARD_TxCpltCallback(), HAL_SMARTCARD_RxCpltCallback() user callbacks
 738:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              will be executed respectively at the end of the Transmit or Receive process
 739:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              The HAL_SMARTCARD_ErrorCallback() user callback will be executed when a communication
 740:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****              error is detected.
 741:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 742:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) Blocking mode APIs are :
 743:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Transmit()
 744:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Receive()
 745:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 746:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) Non Blocking mode APIs with Interrupt are :
 747:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Transmit_IT()
 748:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Receive_IT()
 749:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_IRQHandler()
 750:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 751:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) Non Blocking mode functions with DMA are :
 752:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Transmit_DMA()
 753:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Receive_DMA()
 754:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 755:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) A set of Transfer Complete Callbacks are provided in non Blocking mode:
 756:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_TxCpltCallback()
 757:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_RxCpltCallback()
 758:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_ErrorCallback()
 759:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c **** 
 760:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****   [..]
 761:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****     (#) Non-Blocking mode transfers could be aborted using Abort API's :
 762:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Abort()
 763:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_AbortTransmit()
 764:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_AbortReceive()
 765:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_Abort_IT()
 766:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smartcard.c ****         (##) HAL_SMARTCARD_AbortTransmit_IT()
